n<p>③1スルー(2回目)150G当選の台<br>1スルー(2回目)時150G当選の場合は2スルー(3回目)以降は高確かチャンスモード可能性アップ。<br>恐らく4スルー(5回目)まで0Gから打てる。</p>\n\n\n\n<p>④2スルー(3回目)150G当選の台<br>シナリオ4の可能性アップ。<br>恐らく4スルー(5回目)まで0Gから打てる。</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://suroschool.jp/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/DC5E54A5-0D5C-44F7-8DA2-340103DA3828-162x300.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h3>示唆</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://suroschool.jp/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/549E08D7-2694-4A40-BB2F-154B798AE474-300x282.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://suroschool.jp/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/917B6CA8-43BE-4ED8-8648-70D279ED0A4C-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://suroschool.jp/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/6BBCDC3C-8DB2-4B44-9A11-3A7A93CC9258-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://suroschool.jp/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/C644AE98-5CCD-4AAE-A84D-91CEC67404B7-277x300.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://suroschool.jp/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/3D2BECA5-14E2-4617-A439-57E973406616-171x300.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://suroschool.jp/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/5FCD4F56-77CC-4371-BA00-B04457A18809-260x300.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure>","rewritten":true},"hasSpec":true,"hasShukei":false}